{"id":"steam-1356870","steam":1356870,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Catwink","summary":"Catwink is a 3-6 player fast-paced card game that mixes Crazy Eights with Hot Potato. Sabotage your opponents and deflect incoming attacks as you race to get rid of all your cards. Every card triggers an effect that can flip the game on its head!","about":"Compete with up to 5 of your friends (or strangers) in this card-matching party game of chaos and mischief!\r\n\r\nGet rid of all your cards by matching them with cards in the discard pile. Every card triggers an effect that can help you or hinder your opponents. Enhance your play with cards that grant extra turns, give your cards to other players, and redraw your entire hand. Force other players to draw more cards with Attack cards. Deflect attacks from your opponents by matching certain cards like Skip and Reverse. Up the ante by stacking more Attack cards. Copy your opponents with Copycat cards, or introduce even more chaos with Random cards.\r\n\r\nEvery card has potential to turn the tides of the game in your favor. Strategically use card effects to pull off surprise victories!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/library_600x900.jpg?t=1715435031","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/header.jpg?t=1715435031","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/library_hero.jpg?t=1715435031","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/header.jpg?t=1715435031","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/ss_98693359a130639beeae15a6c00d12c48547f117.600x338.jpg?t=1715435031","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356870/ss_98693359a130639beeae15a6c00d12c48547f117.jpg?t=1715435031"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a